                "retweet_count": 581,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "When you think American politics can\u2019t get any more ironic \u2013 it just did.\n\u00a0\nMSNBC\u2019s decision not to carry President Trump\u2019s victory speech was based on the idea that they are just interested in the \u2018truth\u2019. This network and all other major networks gave breathless coverage to the Russia hoax and have virtually ignored the disaster called the Biden Administration.\u00a0\n\nIf you\u2019re looking for the truth, I\u2019d find another channel.\n\n https://t.co/hFyoHs9EmV",
