                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The coverage given to the illegal immigrant from El Salvador by the Mainstream Media is a hundredfold compared to the coverage that was given to those raped and murdered by illegal immigrants, like Rachel Morin. \n\nClearly Democrats and Liberal Media missed the biggest point of the last election.",
