                "quoted_status_profile_username": "foxnewspolitics",
                "reply_count": 124,
                "retweet_count": 24,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "President Trump\u2019s decision to award the Presidential Medal of Freedom to Dr. @RealBenCarson is well-deserved. A renowned surgeon and conservative thought leader, Dr. Carson has had a tremendous impact on the lives of his patients and the conservative movement he loves so dearly. Dr. Carson has been one of the strongest proponents for the unborn and with this award, I\u2019m even more honored to have his support for my reelection.\n \nDr. Carson is a good and decent man. No one is more deserving of this incredible achievement.",
