                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 738,
                "retweet_count": 574,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Mr. President, your highlighting of the scam called Obamacare - where insurance companies are receiving tens of billions of dollars while patients\u2019 premiums have doubled - is making a real difference. \n\nI appreciate you calling out the money sucking big insurance company scheme called Obamacare and offering a common sense solution. Give the money to the people - not insurance companies- to buy better health care at lower costs. \n\nYour focus on this issue is going to help end this government shutdown nightmare.",
